#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/mark-messages-unread.rst:7
msgid ""
"If you read a message, but don't have time to address it right away, you "
"can mark that message as unread. Marking a message as unread displays the"
" channel as bold in the channel sidebar, and groups the message with all "
"other unread messages."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/mark-messages-unread.rst:11
msgid ""
"Hover over the message, select the **More** |more-icon| option, then "
"select **Mark as Unread**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:16
msgid "Use the More icon to access additional message options."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/mark-messages-unread.rst:13
msgid ""
"When you hover over messages, you can access more message options from "
"the More icon."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/mark-messages-unread.rst:16
msgid "You can mark messages as unread to return to them later."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/mark-messages-unread.rst:21
msgid "Long press a message, and then tap **Mark as Unread**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/mark-messages-unread.rst:23
